note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note omegallm xpool.om: static bank-B pools for target x86linux (which does not support dynamic
note `global ... *` enlarge pools). Sizes at the CONTRACT-V3 maxima (V 4096, T 256, D 384, H 16,
note F 1536, L 16):
note  oww parameters of layers LA .. L-1: (16 - 7) LSTR = 9 1770240 -> 15932160 (LA = 7)
note  ogb BLK values past OGC: P - OGC = 29995392 - 15833472 -> 14161920
note  oab activations of layers LAA .. L-1: (16 - 6) ASTR = 10 1573376 -> 15733760 (LAA = 6)
const OWWN ulong 15932160
global oww f64 15932160
const OGBN ulong 14161920
global ogb f64 14161920
const OABN ulong 15733760
global oab f64 15733760
const OPABN ulong 0
global opab f64 1

fn olp_grow w ulong g ulong a ulong to bool
ret and le w OWWN and le g OGBN le a OABN
end

fn olp_grow_pa pa ulong to bool
ret eq pa 0
end
